{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloomsome is a Make-over Puzzle Game that reflects upon unfair beauty standards through shaping botanical characters. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/50f17bb129efbe21d1a74a26801470b7.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/50f17bb129efbe21d1a74a26801470b7.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/50f17bb129efbe21d1a74a26801470b7.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dystopian and dark prologue chapters, as employed by the Beauty Company, player need to follow social media trends to fulfill client's celebrity dreams. In these chapters, player witness the transformative stories between floral clients Meadow and her daughter Mossy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meadow has been craving for love from butterfly, so she visited the beauty company several times, to get a makeover by following the popular celebrity trends of the web, so as to attract butterflies' attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/65a03e95843332145cc06d30e5d10121.avif?t=1762926706\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras_big/65a03e95843332145cc06d30e5d10121.webp?t=1762926706 width=1560 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Meadow visiting Beauty Company several times, as a teen and later on, as a mom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When Mossy was born, Meadow also brings her in to have a makeover, to help her become pretty and be loved. But Mossy, as a rebellious one, refuse to be transformed and eventually work together with player to undertake an attack to the Beauty Company.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/b8c5e2438f85e07bfd60e39a78bf83f9.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meadow brings in Mossy to have a make over</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these prologue chapters, by the rule of the Beauty Company, player need to use all kinds of tools to shape the body of floral characters, to fit in with the shape boundary and meet criterion to mimic celebrity looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/00c2d6da15bcf8b349ea3a0d20168329.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1026 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/00c2d6da15bcf8b349ea3a0d20168329.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/00c2d6da15bcf8b349ea3a0d20168329.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking away from the Beauty Company, Mossy and Meadow decided to open their own nature beauty shop. Their philosophy is to identify the natural beauty from unique clients and strengthen their functions to help clients live a healthier and authentic life.\u00a0 They aim to provide ASMR soothing experience during the makeover to heal client's heart and soul.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/377b3b1f64f1d5a68a6739a15d722088.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/377b3b1f64f1d5a68a6739a15d722088.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/377b3b1f64f1d5a68a6739a15d722088.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use sunshine energy to guide the position of petals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/c971be0b73296b5e0d650335dda93eeb.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=914 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/c971be0b73296b5e0d650335dda93eeb.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/c971be0b73296b5e0d650335dda93eeb.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">tune sounds to generate beautiful melodies to cheer up the client</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the meaning of beauty and who should be defining that? Running a natural beauty shop along the way, Meadow and Mossy gradually understands the power of self-validation for unique ones and pursuits of diversified perspectives. And they will for sure share it along with the floral community to Bloom Some together :)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032110?t=1762926706","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/e5f13b6614f95624692f0539b166d042e40807ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762926706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/97fc1c802eae1a8205a33b71654eb541458f37ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762926706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/97fc1c802eae1a8205a33b71654eb541458f37ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762926706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4037790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloomsome is a Make-over Puzzle Game that reflects upon unfair beauty standards through shaping botanical characters. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/50f17bb129efbe21d1a74a26801470b7.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/50f17bb129efbe21d1a74a26801470b7.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/50f17bb129efbe21d1a74a26801470b7.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the dystopian and dark prologue chapters, as employed by the Beauty Company, player need to follow social media trends to fulfill client's celebrity dreams. In these chapters, player witness the transformative stories between floral clients Meadow and her daughter Mossy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meadow has been craving for love from butterfly, so she visited the beauty company several times, to get a makeover by following the popular celebrity trends of the web, so as to attract butterflies' attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/65a03e95843332145cc06d30e5d10121.avif?t=1762926706\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras_big/65a03e95843332145cc06d30e5d10121.webp?t=1762926706 width=1560 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Meadow visiting Beauty Company several times, as a teen and later on, as a mom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > When Mossy was born, Meadow also brings her in to have a makeover, to help her become pretty and be loved. But Mossy, as a rebellious one, refuse to be transformed and eventually work together with player to undertake an attack to the Beauty Company.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/b8c5e2438f85e07bfd60e39a78bf83f9.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meadow brings in Mossy to have a make over</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In these prologue chapters, by the rule of the Beauty Company, player need to use all kinds of tools to shape the body of floral characters, to fit in with the shape boundary and meet criterion to mimic celebrity looks.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/00c2d6da15bcf8b349ea3a0d20168329.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1026 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/00c2d6da15bcf8b349ea3a0d20168329.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/00c2d6da15bcf8b349ea3a0d20168329.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking away from the Beauty Company, Mossy and Meadow decided to open their own nature beauty shop. Their philosophy is to identify the natural beauty from unique clients and strengthen their functions to help clients live a healthier and authentic life.\u00a0 They aim to provide ASMR soothing experience during the makeover to heal client's heart and soul.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/377b3b1f64f1d5a68a6739a15d722088.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=1170 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/377b3b1f64f1d5a68a6739a15d722088.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/377b3b1f64f1d5a68a6739a15d722088.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use sunshine energy to guide the position of petals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/c971be0b73296b5e0d650335dda93eeb.poster.avif?t=1762926706\" width=914 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/c971be0b73296b5e0d650335dda93eeb.webm?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/extras/c971be0b73296b5e0d650335dda93eeb.mp4?t=1762926706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">tune sounds to generate beautiful melodies to cheer up the client</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the meaning of beauty and who should be defining that? Running a natural beauty shop along the way, Meadow and Mossy gradually understands the power of self-validation for unique ones and pursuits of diversified perspectives. And they will for sure share it along with the floral community to Bloom Some together :)</p>","developers":["Ruofu Sun","Alice Yu"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/ca09d0cd03bfd80462833faa230c08d42e79d724/header.jpg?t=1762926706","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Bloomsome","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10, Windows\u00ae 11, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or better AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> \tNVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060\uff08VRAM 6GB\uff09or better AMD Radeon RX 590\uff08VRAM 8GB\uff09or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Alice Yu","Ruofu Sun"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0