.jpg?t=1762926706","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/051373a1a4ed0693216236f9a41296e33b1a2191/ss_051373a1a4ed0693216236f9a41296e33b1a2191.600x338.jpg?t=1762926706"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/88e92aacf830accf760eb887956612f7cc137140/ss_88e92aacf830accf760eb887956612f7cc137140.1920x1080.jpg?t=1762926706","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032110/88e92aacf830accf760eb887956612f7cc137140/ss_88e92aacf830accf760eb887956612f7cc137140.600x338.jpg?t=1762926706"}],"short_description":"Bloomsome is a 2D Make-Over Puzzle Game that reflects upon unfair beauty standards. Who should be the one to define what is beauty? We project our reflections and imaginations upon those floral characters which all shine uniquely.","steam_appid":4032110,"support_info":{"email":"ruofu.sun@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}